'''Summon Spectral Wolf''' is a [[skill]] that summons an allied Spectral Wolf [[minion]] for a duration.

==Skill mechanics and interactions==
Summon Spectral Wolf is affected by [[support gem]]s socketed into the item that grants the skill, regardless of whether the [[socket]]s are linked. As it is not an actual [[skill gem]], it cannot be supported by {{il|Empower Support}}, {{il|Enhance Support}}, and {{il|Enlighten Support}}.

Spectral Wolves last for 30 seconds by default, use a melee {{sl|id=Melee}}, and scale with the player's modifiers to [[critical strike chance]] and critical strike multiplier for [[claw]]s. Generic sources of crit and crit multi do not apply. Each wolf also grants a stackable flat physical attack damage buff.

The maximum number of Spectral Wolves a player can have is 10 from all sources.

The triggered version of this skill from the Crucible passive or [[Pack Mentality]] has a [[cooldown]] of 0.5 seconds.

==Acquisition==
This skill can only be gained indirectly through certain items or modifiers:

Level 10:
* [[Crafting bench]] modifier: {{c|crafted|Trigger Level 10 Summon Spectral Wolf on Kill}}
* [[Jorgin]]'s amulet signature [[veiled mod]]: {{ml|JunMasterVeiledWolfOnKill___|display=stat_text}}
* {{il|Rigwald's Crest}}: {{ml|SummonWolfOnKillUnique__1New}}
Level 25:
* {{il|Law of the Wilds}}: {{ml|SummonWolfOnCritUnique__1}}

